<title>THAILAND: Thaimex Finance to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Thaimex Finance to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thaimex Finance and Securities Plc said on Monday it will issue debentures worth up to five billion baht.</p>
<p>The debentures will have maturity of no more than five years and be issued in foreign currencies and baht, Thaimex said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>The company's board will work out the details of the debentures later, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
